  "details": "Hi!\n\nI think it would be nice to be able to change certain Physbone parameters (like pull, immobile) while it is posed. Or maybe disable the physbone physics entirely during pose. When you release the pose, it should go back to normal.\n\nI want to be able to \"tuck\" my hair away in the back by posing it there, but right now it just keeps the same physics as before and will simply float around instead of staying put there.\n\nUnfortunately you can't animate any Physbone parameters with animations, so the isPosed parameter doesn't help me either.\n\nWould be amazing to have that feature :)",
